00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:00.810
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.930
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.470
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.430
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:19.810
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.180
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.680
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:30.180
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:32.810
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:35.310
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:37.100
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:42.310
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:45.720
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:50.890
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:51.970
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:55.560
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.930
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.640
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.890
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:12.430
<b>Material Problem</b>

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:17.830
Come on, help yourself.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:18.790
It's my treat today.

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:20.910
What happened? You seem to be delighted.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.080
We're going really smooth with the team.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.120
We even got the ancient god.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.910
It's enough to start a team.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:28.750
What do we want?

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.200
The championship!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.950
We still got a long way to go though.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:33.700
I mean, you've seen Yifan.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.500
In a champion team, he's a nobody.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.250
In our team, he's the second best.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.450
I say there's still some distance
between us and the championship.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:42.830
You said we're gonna get the championship.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:44.450
You gotta know how to do it, right?

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.120
Well, just take our time.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:49.000
The leveling-up, the items, they all take time.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.040
How about you, Tang?

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.870
If you wanna be a pro, maybe
you should stop taking the shifts.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:55.450
Focus on training.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:56.330
I'll pay you anyway.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.000
I...

00:02:58.790 --> 00:02:59.410
OK.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.450
How's Steamed Bun doing?

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.330
He was there pretty much every time I got on.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:10.120
Whenever I leveled up, he would send
that meme with the screaming groundhog.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.450
I think he is about level 51 or 52.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.220
What about Concealed Light?

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:17.830
Same with Steamed Bun.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.150
Yeah, step by step.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.200
Now we have master Ye Xiu in charge.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:24.120
Both Tang and Steamed Bun are diamonds in the rough.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.830
Concealed Light may not be
that good, but he's got potentials.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.770
Plus that former low-rank captain from Blue Rain.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:34.660
If Qiao from the champion team
and Su Mucheng will also join us,

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.870
our team will be absolutely promising!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:49.790
What happened to her?

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.700
Wasn't she in a great mood at noon?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:53.370
I don't know.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.950
Well, I talked with Loulan Slash this afternoon.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.160
Loulan Slash?

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.700
I asked him what it takes to join the League.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:07.790
So?

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.410
He said you have to have your own venue.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:14.200
And next season, they'll go with holographic-projection.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:17.750
So for a club, you have to have the equipments for that.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:19.450
Our cafe...

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.160
I don't think if I can make it.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:22.950
I'm sorry.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.290
It's okay.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:32.190
I wasn't going to apply for it like they did.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.540
Didn't you know that?

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.410
Every year, the League will weed out two teams.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.330
That means, there will be two spots open.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.700
One is like what Loulan Slash did,
you make an application to the League,

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.660
you will be a part of it once you got approved.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:51.500
But the other spot, goes to the Challenge.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.410
Challenge?

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:56.580
You mean the Resurrection?

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:57.840
Yeah.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.580
For some reasons, the Challenge is
mostly known as the Resurrection.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.750
What reasons?

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.950
The Challenge requires only two things from its participants.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.160
Enough team members, and the entry money.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:15.370
That means, professional teams got eliminated
from the season can also take part in the Challenge.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.890
(Blue Rain, Samsara, Tiny Herb, Tyranny, Bright Green, Miracle)

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:21.660
Compared to the amateurs, the pro-teams can be rather good.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:29.200
Up to now, every winner in all seasons has been the pro-team.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.330
So the Challenge is now called the Resurrection.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.900
(Bright Green, Miracle)

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.950
Sometimes, there might even be more than two teams.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.120
There will be three or even four teams.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:52.790
Those that failed the last Resurrection
might come again for the new season.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.040
Oh, I see.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.830
So all we need to do is to survive at the Challenge.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.790
Those requirements, we can just leave them to the League.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.330
Now that I think about it, I don't think we
had any amateur team in the League before.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.500
Looks like I'm about to make another history.

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.580
But that's not the point, is it?

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.410
The Resurrection goes by knock-out.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.500
One lose, and you're out.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.000
If we...

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:19.000
Even we go by application, teams that
barely pass will simply not be valued.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.750
The Challenge is our only chance.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:25.500
Instead of worrying about the "if",
we should just focus to stop it from happening.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:27.500
That's right.

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:31.330
This season's Challenge is in progress.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:32.700
You can check it out.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.750
(Glory Challenge is on!)

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:40.540
When the regular season ends,
the Challenge will come to its end as well.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.830
Twenty teams for next season will be determined by then.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.000
We have to work on it.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:51.820
Absolutely.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.120
I think it's the material.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:56.950
Qiang got us something.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.080
That's fast.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.540
He's quite efficient.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:00.790
<b>Studio of Qiang</b>

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:01.750
I got two bad news.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.120
Which one you wanna hear it first?

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:04.790
Just tell me both of them.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.620
First, you've run out of money.

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:08.910
Second, I still didn't get all the materials you need.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:12.080
Thank you.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.580
Looks like I have to get the rest myself.

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:18.600
(You've logged in to Happy Cafe)

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.500
<b>Your friend [Lord Grim] is online</b>

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.870
We'll then get to it as soon as possible.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.680
(Area: Wild - The Tenth District)

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.080
Why are you back?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.660
I'm here for the boss.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.000
Topaz Knight.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.370
The one with Blue-white Crystal.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:43.870
I think it's the right name.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:45.290
You want Blue-white Crystal?

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.000
Yeah.

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:47.580
Does your guild have any?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.250
No.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.620
How many times had the Topaz Knight been killed?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.450
By which guilds?

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.120
I'm not your spy!

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.950
I don't know anything about any other guilds!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.620
The record has been cracked three times,

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:15.250
by Tyrannical Ambition, Herb Garden, and Excellent Dynasty.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.290
So your guild is so lame to be easily cracked?

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.650
(Lame)

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.500
You...!

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:26.450
We had great wins over other dungeons.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.910
You think I'll brag to you about that?

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.580
You helped to take care of our Happy guild recently?

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:34.660
Yeah, kind of.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.660
How's Happy doing?

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.160
It's on the right path.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.200
Going pretty good.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.000
Then it's time to establish the warehouse system.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:49.120
If we ain't got no top gears in the warehouse
to attract players, our guild will lose it sooner or later.

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:50.330
You think so?

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.370
Yeah.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:56.250
So, do you have items that you don't need in Blue Brook?

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.930
I don't mind having them.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:08:59.500
No!

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.540
Go get them yourself!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:05.650
Who you think I am?

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.450
Who is available now?

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:11.370
Captain's back.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.080
--What's your plan with this comeback?
--You're back!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:13.910
-I'm here for the boss.
-Oh, my god!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.290
-Wanna join in?
-It must be my birthday today!

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.070
-Cap, you're great!
-Can't wait!

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:16.870
-I so wanna know!
-Me too!

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:17.560
Which Boss?

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.910
Level 50 wild boss Topaz Knight.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.250
If you know it, go to the leveling area in Western Wildness.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.450
Call me when you find it.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.370
Be on it!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:25.450
Cap, you're great!

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:26.330
On my way.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.080
I'll get others.

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.620
Don't we have spies from other guilds in the group?

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.080
You're not worried that they're gonna steal our boss?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.620
It's not gonna be that easy to steal from me.

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:36.620
<b>Group: Strategies Against Lord Grim</b>

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.370
Lord Grim is going for the Topaz Knight!

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.410
You have spies in Happy, too?

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.660
He's gonna be that dumb,
to announce his project in the World?

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.370
He must have done it on purpose.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:48.410
He allocates the main force to the Western Wildness,

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.330
to trick us into believing
that his target is Topaz Knight.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:52.310
But in fact, he aims for something else.
(Level 50, Leveling Area - Western Wilderness)

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:55.120
What would be his real goal then?

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:56.410
Wait.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.410
What if his real target is the Topaz Knight?

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.790
This could be a misleading to distract us!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:03.950
But that won't be necessary.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.040
Our attentions are distracted anyway.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.290
Clear all mobs in this area as quickly as possible.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.220
That's right.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.830
--We have to create space for the boss.
--I say we just focus on their main force.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.330
See where they can go.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:15.250
You mean Soft Mist and Steamed Bun Invasion?

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:18.120
We got it.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.620
Our source said Happy's elites went to Omar Mountain.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.700
So his real goal is the Sunset Hunter of Omar Mountain!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.580
Well, let's send some elites there!

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.500
But what if their real target is Topaz Knight?

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:32.700
What should we do then?

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:33.830
Don't worry.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.290
We will send more men to the Western Wildness.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.950
Let's give them an elite VS elite.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.370
Crowd VS crowd.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.830
It's not like they have anyone great in Happy.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.290
If we got the same number, we can have a sure win.

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:57.550
Level 50 Wild Boss: Topaz Knight

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.080
Go get it!

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:03.830
Take it down!

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.000
We have to get the boss before Happy does!

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:11.080
Let's go!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.350
(Level 50, Leveling Area - Omar Mountain)

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.830
How come the Sunset Hunters hasn't popped yet?

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.250
Cap, something's wrong with the Western Wildness.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.290
What happened?

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.330
We can't contain the Boss.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.450
We're about to be aced.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.040
Are you kidding me?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.040
You got aced so fast?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:34.910
What the heck are you doing?

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:36.750
That's right.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:39.910
Only guild elites can crack wild boss.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.330
Regular players have no actual combat experience at all.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:48.450
If our men can't do it, neither can those rookies of Happy.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:54.700
Follow up!

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.790
Cap, Happy's not like us.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:58.410
What's the difference?

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.700
Mages, ranged skill!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:02.500
They got better commander!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:04.120
All aim at it!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.500
I forgot!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.750
He's one of the four Master Tacticians!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:22.430
Congratulations on Happy cracking Level 50 Boss.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.850
Happy Guild successfully killed Level 50 Wild Boss Topaz Knight!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:27.200
Congratulations on Happy cracking Level 50 Boss.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.660
Topaz Knight.

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:30.620
So many drops!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.900
They look amazing!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:34.750
We're rich now!

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:37.080
Earth Badge!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.330
The best orange item!

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:42.830
This is a result of all our contribution.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:45.910
So this belongs to the guild.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.160
I'll put it in the guild warehouse later.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.830
You can check out the rules when you enter warehouse.

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.550
The King's Avatar 2

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.790
What do you want again?

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:09.410
Can I take a look at Blue Brook's warehouse system?

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:13.870
Come on.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:15.370
It's not like it's worth hiding.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:17.330
It's out there for everyone to see.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.290
What's with you today?

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:20.540
First you went online out of a blue.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:21.620
Then you stole the boss.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.330
Now you want the warehouse system.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:25.520
Say it!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.290
What are you up to?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.080
I'm minding the guild, aren't all guilds like this?

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:31.410
I'm not up to anything.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.410
Can you make it quick?

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.830
I don't want to copy and paste.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.370
Just give me your file.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:37.910
It can't be that easy.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:40.500
I mean, are you...?

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.660
Don't be melodramatic.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.040
I just want the guild to be regular.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:45.200
Cut the crap.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.500
Send me the file.

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:47.570
That's it.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:58.540
Master, can you please change the name?

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.410
Thank you very much.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.870
What name?

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:06.100
Happy Guild

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.850
<b>Warehouse system for Blue Brook Guild</b>

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.040
Now I see.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.370
Send it to me one more time.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:14.540
I just deleted the file.

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.830
This one seems different.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:30.620
I changed it.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:31.250
Nice.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.910
It's much better than the previous one.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.080
You know your desk work.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.370
Who wrote the previous one?

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:37.500
It's too wordy.

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.200
I wrote that one, too!

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.790
Big guild's got so many talents.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.910
I wish we can have someone like you in our team.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.080
What do you want?

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.160
I'm just saying, someone talented like you,

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:54.660
if you can't come to Happy to put yourself in good use,

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.160
that would be a waste.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:56.910
Bye.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:05.450
Boss.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:08.080
The warehouse is done.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:10.000
It's not always convenient to come back to District 10.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:11.620
I'll set you as the administrator.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.700
Don't make me the captain though.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.040
We need your name there.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.540
I know.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.330
There's just one orange equipment in our warehouse.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.660
It's rather shabby.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.540
I'll give you all the materials I have.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.160
You can trade the regular materials
with some advanced equipments.

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:28.580
Fill out the warehouse.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.660
So you don't need those materials?

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.910
I am now in Heavenly Domain.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.470
If I want to upgrade my umbrella,
I need better materials anyway.

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.770
Confirm the transaction?

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:38.470
Transaction Completed

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.000
Old Ye.
Windward Formation

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:42.750
Where are you right now?

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:43.080
Windward Formation

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.250
Boss Leipole has just popped!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.620
Come to Heavenly Domain's Poison Fang Swamp!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:49.430
(Level 65, Leveling Area - Poison Fang Swamp)

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.700
The boss was just out.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.790
And all eight guilds got here.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:07.200
And I thought you were ahead of them.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.000
Are we going scrap-picking?

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:09.950
Or are we going to steal the boss?

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.080
How can we go scrap-picking?

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.660
We are the well-known big shots.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.910
Unless we really can't steal it...

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:19.080
So big shot, tell me about your plan.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.950
I got the despicable you here, that's my plan.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.660
But be careful, don't expose yourself.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.120
Your reputation is just like shit right now.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.160
You're the favorite of the flies.

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:29.700
Hello, fly.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:34.180
(Heavenly Domain's Arena - Sky Abattoir)

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:37.830
Lord Grim often used our conflicts to steal the wild boss.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.870
If we engage in another dispute, it will only benefit him.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:48.290
Therefore, Swamp Hunter Leipole
will belong to the winner of this guilds' contest.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.120
All eight guilds agreed as this post showed.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:52.410
Round 1.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:56.580
Arisaema from Herb Garden VS Three Realms from Samsara.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.500
It's been half an hour.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.620
Why hasn't anyone moved yet?

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.500
Go check out the forum.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:12.120
They came to the negotiation.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:13.540
Of what?

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.910
They want to decide the ownership
of the boss by arena contest.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:21.370
After all these years of fighting, now they've changed?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.040
So we can't take advantage of their fights ever again?

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.410
Let's not jump to conclusion.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:29.250
Seeing the shabby ID above your head,
I did come up with something.

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.320
(Windward Formation, Blue Brook)

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.000
The final round, Three Realms from Samsara wins.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.830
So the boss goes to...

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.910
Wait, cap Three Realm.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.950
Blue Brook went for the boss without noticing us!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.250
What?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.160
How can they be so crooked?

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.410
Blue Brook went for the boss!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.370
We didn't!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.200
You still gonna lie?

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.370
It is one of your man who's containing the boss!

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:02.970
(Windward Formation, Blue Brook)

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.080
Let's not make a move yet.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.620
Let's find out what's really going on here.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:10.040
You want us to be on hold so you
Blue Brook can steal the boss?

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:12.370
Brothers, go!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.290
Slay these shameless punks of Blue Brook!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.120
Samsara brothers, Excellent Dynasty is here to help!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:21.910
I don't believe you.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:23.700
I know you're here for the boss as well!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.530
Why are you fighting with each other?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.500
Blue Brook is got the boss now!

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.000
Don't you pretend to be the good guy!

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:33.620
You are just as low as they are!

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.410
I got the boss coming our way!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:43.080
Are you ready?

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.290
We've been waiting for quite a long time.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:45.870
Get ready to fight!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:51.160
Blue Brook broke the agreement, and tried to steal the boss.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.370
We must get to the bottom of this today.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.330
You think the ID can really prove he's from Blue Brook?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:57.910
Are you new in Glory or what?

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:02.540
All the captains, I know you have
accounts with the ID from Blue Brook.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.870
Like we're buying it from you.

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.500
This could just be another plot of Blue Brook.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:13.330
For a Level 65 Boss, you think we would
do things like this to stain our names?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.700
Please think rationally.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:16.410
Is it really worth it?

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:21.580
I believe none of the guilds here
would have done such a shameless deed.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.700
There must be somebody else behind this.

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:24.870
Is it...?

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.400
Brothers, let's go!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.700
Hold on the attack.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:46.040
I got approached by a guild.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.410
They wanna pay me more in exchange of the boss.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.160
What?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.120
What did they say?

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.660
This boss is now more than just materials.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.200
It's now about the reputations of the clubs.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.250
Gentlemen, you have to hurry up.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:03.870
The boss will go on rampage every second.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:07.250
When it goes rampage, we can't really hold on our attack.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.790
What do you think of the material list I made?

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.100
It's great.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:15.200
But you have to work with us and clarify it to the public

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.790
that this whole mess was caused
by Lord Grim and his accomplices.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.250
It has nothing to do with Blue Brook.

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:21.620
In accordance with our agreement at the arena,

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.670
Samsara will be the one to finish the boss.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:25.870
Sure.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.120
You give me the materials.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.160
I give you the boss.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.830
Since Samsara agrees, it's a deal, then.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.500
I'll get you the materials right now.

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:35.770
That Deep Composed Ash you want, I got it for you.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.870
<b>From Windward Formation on secret channel</b>

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.000
That's it?

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:39.370
<b>From Windward Formation on secret channel</b>

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:42.120
I can have it once I slay the boss.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.910
I suffer from great losses if that's the only thing I got.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:44.410
<b>From Windward Formation on secret channel</b>

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:46.120
Of course, that's not going to be the only thing.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:46.580
<b>From Windward Formation on secret channel</b>

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:48.120
But I need the rest.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.310
<b>From Windward Formation on secret channel</b>

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:51.290
You are a real bastard, you know that?

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.580
I went through all these for you.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.290
You want to get rid of me with that Deep Composed Ash?

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:56.040
Get me more materials.

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:57.700
Or I will kill the boss right now!

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:01.910
Gentlemen, the situation has changed.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.000
What?

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:04.870
Something wrong with the boss?

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.160
Here's the thing.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:09.700
I have a low-rank partner.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.250
He saw how bad you needed the boss,

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.700
so he decided to take a good advantage of you.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.500
Even I feel ashamed of him.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:17.910
We have no other options.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:19.700
He's got the boss right now.

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:23.530
So I have to give you his list as well.

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:26.160
Lord Grim is already too much to take,

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.160
now we have someone who is lower than him?

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.580
We are really going down.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:33.870
Gentlemen, are you going to take it from here,

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.830
or shall we just join your team?

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:36.580
Don't worry.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:38.500
We won't charge you extra for after service.

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.660
It's okay.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:41.620
We'll do it ourselves...

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:43.450
You!
(Windward Formation, Blue Brook)

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:45.700
You're the spy who framed us!

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:48.370
Well, that's me.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.950
If it's okay with you, I hope you don't kick me out of the guild.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:51.750
Why?

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:54.410
Because you got better welfare.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:57.870
How could anyone be so shameless?

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:00.250
(You have been removed from Blue Brook)

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.950
Such a big guild, such a small heart.

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:04.660
See ya!

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:05.850
Looking forward to seeing you again.

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:08.450
It's so hard to upgrade the silver weapon.

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:10.700
We blackmailed them with the boss, but still didn't get much.

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.830
I have been kicked out of the guild.

00:22:14.820 --> 00:22:16.530
Heavenly Domain is not like the new district.

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:18.410
They are more in power.

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:20.370
And I am simply weak.

00:22:20.830 --> 00:22:24.660
After this event, they will definitely
see me as a threat to the boss.

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:28.500
If they really decides to guard me for it, it's gonna be tough.

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:31.000
You're right.

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:34.950
Stealing the boss is worse than killing their guild captain.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:41.250
If only we can know who will hold on
to the drops when they finish the boss.

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:43.350
Then we don't have to steal the boss, we can just rob him.

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:45.660
You certainly have no limits.

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:47.580
Limits?

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:48.330
What are they?

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:49.370
Can they pay the rental on my humble flat?

00:22:49.370 --> 00:22:51.200
I just want materials. Ma-te-rials!

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:56.040
Maybe we should send more spies to them for the materials.

00:22:57.330 --> 00:22:57.950
Spies?

00:22:58.290 --> 00:22:59.060
Like how?

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:01.830
This time, let's send in the whole group.

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:07.750
You see, with your skills and abilities
you can easily become the core of the guild.

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:12.200
Then you bring in all your gang, get an elite spy team going.

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:14.950
All material information will be on your plate.

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:16.910
You are so shameless.

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.700
You want me and my brothers to be in fire pit?

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.540
I wouldn't say it's a fire pit.

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:23.250
I mean, they do have great welfare.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:24.200
You know?

00:23:24.830 --> 00:23:25.660
Well, that's true.

00:23:26.410 --> 00:23:28.120
Which guild we should go, any suggestions?

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:30.200
As long as you can nail it, take whichever you like.

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:31.670
How about Samsara?

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:35.370
From what they've done today,
they definitely want the attention.

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:36.750
They are aiming big.

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:38.450
Samsara sounds nice.

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:42.160
If they wanna play it big, it will be easier for you to sneak in.

00:23:42.450 --> 00:23:43.650
You will have better shots climbing up.

00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:44.700
Be on it.

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:47.300
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:54.050
(Level 50, Blue-white Crystal)

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:56.870
It's all here.

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:58.040
Come on.

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.520
The equipment can be forged to level 50. Are you sure you want to forge?

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:15.930
Spirit
Intelligence
Strength
Vitality
Magic Attack
Physical Attack
Thousand Chance Umbrella
-Successfully forging-

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:17.250
It's done!

00:24:17.410 --> 00:24:23.910
Physical Attack 535, Magic Attack 535,
Vitality +10, Strength +10, Intelligence +10, Spirit +10.

00:24:24.370 --> 00:24:27.580
Vitality, power, intelligence, spirit, All +10.

00:24:28.040 --> 00:24:29.080
All around.

00:24:29.290 --> 00:24:30.500
Great attributes.

00:24:31.000 --> 00:24:33.200
Level 50 umbrella is now a weapon.

00:24:35.120 --> 00:24:36.870
Knight's weapon, the wand.

00:24:39.500 --> 00:24:40.370
Do you have any money?

00:24:40.620 --> 00:24:41.410
Cash?

00:24:41.410 --> 00:24:42.160
How much you want?

00:24:42.870 --> 00:24:44.120
I mean the game coin.

00:24:44.750 --> 00:24:45.660
Game money?

00:24:46.160 --> 00:24:48.040
I have more than 10,000 gold coins on Chasing Haze.

00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:48.950
I'll have all of them.

00:24:49.450 --> 00:24:50.580
I'll go get a Knight account.

00:24:51.080 --> 00:24:51.910
And some equipments.

00:24:52.410 --> 00:24:53.950
What do you want the Knight for?

00:24:53.950 --> 00:24:55.910
I want to get into a guild as Main Tank.

00:24:55.910 --> 00:24:56.750
I beg your pardon?

00:24:57.120 --> 00:25:00.030
You are saying, you are going in as a spy?

00:25:01.120 --> 00:25:01.950
Yeah, pretty much.

00:25:24.100 --> 00:25:27.220
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:25:28.640 --> 00:25:32.350
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:25:32.600 --> 00:25:37.180
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:25:37.180 --> 00:25:39.350
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:25:41.770 --> 00:25:43.970
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:25:44.310 --> 00:25:45.930
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:25:46.180 --> 00:25:48.060
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:25:48.060 --> 00:25:50.220
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:25:52.930 --> 00:25:54.930
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:25:54.970 --> 00:25:58.220
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:25:58.220 --> 00:26:01.470
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:26:01.470 --> 00:26:03.600
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:05.310
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:26:05.310 --> 00:26:07.100
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:26:07.220 --> 00:26:10.350
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:26:12.470 --> 00:26:14.350
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:26:14.350 --> 00:26:16.520
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪
